<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>With over 20 years of expertise in EPC and construction services, we have a proven track record of delivering impactful projects across Iraq. Our primary focus includes the Oil and Gas sector, Energy and Power, Petrochemicals, Bitumen and Base Oil production, Cement Plant development, and Construction Materials Manufacturing. Additionally, we provide innovative solutions in the Smart Metering industry as well as strategic projects consultancy services. Backed by a team of 1,200+ dedicated employees and experts, we drive sustainable growth, supported by our offices in Iraq, the UAE, and the UK.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->
<!-- /wp:harlow/text -->
